      ":question/problem": "The table below gives the values of a continuous function $f(x)$ over the closed interval $[1, 10]$ with a regular step size. If the left Riemann sum approximation of the area under the curve $y = f(x)$ with $3$ subintervals defined by the given points has a value of $45$, then what must be the value of $k$?\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $4$ | $7$ | $10$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $f(x)$ | $-1$ | $k$ | $9$ | $15$ |\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
